{
  "id": "2SA.14",
  "number": "14",
  "bookId": "2SA",
  "reference": "2 Samueli 14",
  "verseCount": 33,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "14",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2SA 14"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "14",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoabu mwana wa Seruya, alitambua kwamba maelekeo ya moyo wa Daudi yalikuwa kwa Absalomu tu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hivyo alituma watu huko Tekoa ili wamtafutie mwanamke mwenye hekima. Walipomleta, akamwambia, “Jisingizie unafanya matanga. Vaa nguo za kuomboleza, usijipake mafuta, ila ujifanye kama mwanamke ambaye amekuwa katika maombolezo ya wafu kwa muda mrefu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Halafu nenda kwa mfalme ukamwambie yale ninayokuambia.” Kisha Yoabu akamwambia maneno ya kumwambia mfalme. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Huyo mwanamke kutoka Tekoa akaenda kwa mfalme, akaanguka kifudifudi, mbele ya mfalme, akasujudu, akamwambia, “Ee mfalme, nisaidie.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mfalme akamwambia, “Una shida gani?” Yule mwanamke akajibu, “Nasikitika, mimi ni mjane, mume wangu amekufa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nilikuwa na watoto wa kiume wawili. Siku moja, walipokuwa mbugani, walianza kugombana. Kwa vile hapakuwa na mtu yeyote wa kuwaamua, mmoja akampiga mwenzake, akamuua. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sasa ndugu zangu wote wamenigeuka mimi mtumishi wako; wanataka nimtoe kwao mtoto aliyemuua mwenzake ili wamuue kwa kuyaangamiza maisha ya ndugu yake. Hivyo, watamuua huyu ambaye sasa ndiye mrithi. Wakifanya hivyo, watazima kabisa tumaini langu lililobakia, na mume wangu hataachiwa jina wala mzawa duniani.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mfalme akamwambia yule mwanamke, “Rudi nyumbani nitaamuru jambo lako liangaliwe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yule mwanamke kutoka Tekoa akasema, “Bwana wangu mfalme, hatia yote na iwe juu yangu na juu ya jamaa ya baba yangu. Hivyo, wewe na ufalme wako msiwe na hatia.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mfalme akamwambia, “Mtu yeyote akikutishia mlete kwangu na hatakuja kukugusa tena.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yule mwanamke akamwambia, “Tafadhali, mfalme, niombee kwa Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wako, ili yule ndugu yangu ambaye angelipiza kisasi cha mauaji ya mwanangu asifanye hatia nyingine kubwa ya kumwua yule mtoto wangu mwingine.” Mfalme Daudi akamwambia, “Kama Mwenyezi-Mungu aishivyo, hakuna hata unywele mmoja wa mwanao utakaoanguka chini.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yule mwanamke akamwambia, “Nakuomba, mimi mtumishi wako, uniruhusu niseme neno moja kwako mfalme.” Mfalme akamwambia, “Sema”. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yule mwanamke akamwambia, “Kwa nini basi, umepanga uovu huu dhidi ya watu wa Mungu? Kulingana na uamuzi wako juu ya jambo hilo wewe mwenyewe umejihukumu kuwa na hatia kwa sababu humruhusu mwanao arudi nyumbani kutoka alikokimbilia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sisi sote lazima tutakufa. Sisi ni kama maji yaliyomwagika chini ambayo hayazoleki. Hata Mungu hafanyi tofauti kwa mtu huyu na tofauti kwa mwingine; yeye hutafuta njia ili waliopigwa marufuku, wakakimbia, wapate kurudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mimi nimekuja kuzungumza nawe, bwana wangu mfalme, kwani wamenitisha. Basi, mimi mtumishi wako, niliwaza kuwa, ‘Afadhali nikazungumze na mfalme, huenda akanitimizia mahitaji yangu mimi mtumishi wake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maana mfalme atanisikiliza na kuniokoa mikononi mwa mtu ambaye anataka kuniangamiza mimi pamoja na mwanangu kutoka urithi wa Mungu’. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nami mjakazi wako nilifikiri kuwa, ‘Neno lake bwana wangu mfalme litanipa amani moyoni, kwani wewe bwana wangu mfalme ni kama malaika wa Mungu katika kupambanua mema na mabaya.’ Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wako, awe pamoja nawe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipo mfalme alipomjibu yule mwanamke, “Usinifiche jambo lolote nitakalokuuliza.” Yule mwanamke akasema, “Sema bwana wangu mfalme.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mfalme akamwuliza, “Je, Yoabu anahusika katika jambo hili?” Yule mwanamke akasema, “Kama uishivyo, bwana wangu mfalme, mtu hawezi kukwepa kulia au kushoto kuhusu jambo ulilosema bwana wangu mfalme. Yoabu yule mtumishi wako ndiye aliyenituma. Ni yeye aliyeniambia maneno yote haya niliyokuambia mimi mtumishi wako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoabu alifanya hivyo ili kubadilisha mambo. Lakini, wewe bwana wangu, una hekima kama ya malaika wa Mungu hata unaweza kujua mambo yote yaliyoko duniani.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisha, mfalme akamwambia Yoabu, “Sasa sikiliza, natoa kibali changu ili umrudishe nyumbani yule kijana Absalomu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoabu alianguka chini kifudifudi, akasujudu na kumtakia mfalme baraka, akasema, “Leo, mimi mtumishi wako, bwana wangu mfalme, ninajua kuwa nimepata kibali mbele yako, kwa kulikubali ombi langu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hivyo, Yoabu aliondoka, akaenda Geshuri kumleta Absalomu mjini Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini mfalme akasema, “Absalomu aishi mbali nami; aishi nyumbani kwake. Asije hapa kuniona.” Hivyo, Absalomu akawa anaishi mbali, nyumbani kwake na hakumwona mfalme Daudi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Katika Israeli yote, hakuna yeyote aliyesifiwa kwa uzuri kama Absalomu. Tangu nyayo zake hadi utosini mwake, Absalomu hakuwa na kasoro yoyote. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kila alipokata nywele zake, (na kila mwishoni mwa mwaka alikata nywele zake kwani zilikuwa nzito), alipozipima, zilikuwa na uzito wa kilo mbili kulingana na vipimo vya kifalme. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Absalomu alizaa watoto watatu wa kiume pamoja na binti mmoja jina lake Tamari. Tamari alikuwa mwanamke mzuri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi, Absalomu aliishi mjini Yerusalemu kwa muda wa miaka miwili mizima bila kumwona mfalme Daudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisha, Absalomu alimtumia ujumbe Yoabu, ili aende kwa mfalme kwa niaba yake, lakini Yoabu akakataa. Absalomu akatuma ujumbe mara ya pili lakini Yoabu akakataa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi, Absalomu akawaambia watumishi wake, “Angalieni Yoabu ana shamba la shayiri karibu na langu. Nendeni mkalichome moto.” Kwa hiyo watumishi wa Absalomu wakalichoma moto shamba la Yoabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoabu akaenda nyumbani kwa Absalomu akamwuliza, “Kwa nini watumishi wako wamechoma moto shamba langu?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Absalomu akamjibu, “Tazama, nilikupelekea ujumbe, uje huku ili nikutume kwa mfalme, ukamwulize: ‘Kwa nini niliondoka Geshuri? Ingekuwa bora kwangu kubaki huko’. Sasa nisaidie nipate kumwona mfalme. Kama nina hatia basi, na aniue!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa hiyo Yoabu akaenda na kumweleza mfalme maneno hayo yote, naye akamwita Absalomu, naye akaingia kwa mfalme, akaanguka kifudifudi mbele ya mfalme. Na mfalme akambusu Absalomu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
